<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">- Bekwel Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Filip</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, pɛ daa Bot ɛ dɛl ɛ Filip</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filip</para>
  <para style="toc3">Fil</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl, Pɛ daa bot ɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ghaada Filip</para>
  <para style="imt">Ɛniel</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl nakus zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ghaada Filip ɛ, é mɛdjoŋ mɛ ebá ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Ye ɛ́ zɛɛga mendjaala mɛkɛn Pɔl nakus kɔ kyee dik Elɔp ɛ. Ghaada Filip ɛ́ pɛ ɛko ɛ dik nɛ pɛ ɛdjem ɛ dwoo ɛ kyee dik Ghɛlɛk, tɔ kyee dik Masedwan.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mɛkana ɛ Pɔl pɛ daa ekeletyɛ ghaada Filip lyaal ɛ tɛtɛ ɛgwakel nyɛ di nɛ yɛ pak bɛ nɛ bot ɛ zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɛ. É sok nyɛ nadi ekwyal mɛkana tak ɛ, nyɛ nadi ɛ́ é membok. Étɛp tak ɛ lyem'ɛ nadi ekpaa etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛkwyee bɛ. Pɔl ɛpekwyɛl ɛdjɛ bɛ mɛghaaz, étɛp bɛ neepyet tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb. Deenek, nyɛ ɛpelɛɛ bɛ kwyɛl nyɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ nɔɔ. Nyɛ ɛpebaabem ba kɔ ɛsu ɛ lɔɔ. Etɛɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot ɛpegoola bhaadal mɛkɔŋ étɛp bɛ neekekɔk kɔ lɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 1:15-17">1.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:21">2.21</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:2">3.2</ref>,<ref loc="PHP 3:18">18</ref></char>). Pɔl ɛpegek ɛkyeed bot ɛ bɛ nɛ bɛ nɔɔ di egyee tɔ mɛsa ɔ pɛ ghaada Filip. Nyɛ nagek deenek ɛ, étɛp bɛ neekɛkwyee bot ɛ zɛɛga mendjaala, da bɛ ɛ́ bula nɛ menduk mɔɔ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2.19-30</ref></char>). Pɛ yɔbɔ kyee, bot ɛ ghaada Filip naakyeed mɛtom pɛ daa Pɔl (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4.10-20</ref></char>). Tɔ mɛkana Pɔl nakyeed pɛ daa bot ɛ Filip ɛ, nyɛ naaghaapɛɛ bɛ. Nyɛ naadjɛ bɛ pe mɛlyo, étɛp bɛ neebela mɛghaaz kɔ ɛsu ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pɔl eeka é mis mɛ bot ɛ ghaada Filip etɛp di dum nɛ <char style="em">tsik nɛ ɛsyee ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ</char> (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 2:6-11">2.6-11</ref></char>). Yezu naabet ekum nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ pɛ daa Sɛɛg ɛ. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, Zɛɛb nadjɛ nyɛ di ekukuma kɔ bot djas nɛ kɔ esonok djas. Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ dáa Pɔl nalum koŋ nɛ eboo bot ɛ nyɛ nadi egu pɛ Yeluzalɛm ɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:3-10">3.3-10</ref></char>). Deenek, nyɛ naamyaal ɛzuk kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto batakɛkum tɔ membok. Nyɛ ɛ́ ndjem étɛp ɛdjɛ tsik'ɛ met, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Yezu. Nyɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, nyɛ waagom dhiiti dwoo pak myoŋ. Nyɛ ɛpelyo nɛ bot ɛ Filip náá, bɛ du geka yɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="PHP 3:17">3.17</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 4:9">4.9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Tɔ ekwyala mɛkana mɛ djas, Pɔl nadi emyaala nɛ sa ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ lɛ nɛ Zɛɛb di edjɛ nyɛ ɛ. Nyɛ ɛpedjɛ mɛghaaz nɛ bot ɛ Filip náá, bɛ <char style="em">di tɔ mɛmyaala</char>. Mɛmyaala menek goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tak ye nakoozodi tɔ mɛtsak, nɛ tɔ mezuk, é ghɛŋ ekeletyɛ di tɔ ɛgwakel pak'ɔɔ ɛ, Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ nɛ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHP 1"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 1:1"/>Ye ɛ́ mam Pɔl nɛ Timote ekwom e mɛsa ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bis kwyal mɛkana mak ɛ, étɛp bot ɛ ghaada Filip, nɛ bot di mos bot ɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto ɔ. Dɔɔ nɛ bot ɛ di edjɛɛd zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala ɔ, zɛnɔɔ eDhyakɛlɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 1:2"/>Beta náá, Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'ena nɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'enaka sa bin enɛm nɛ embɛɛ nɛ ɛdjɛ bin egwyem.<verse eid="PHP 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpebulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 1:3"/>Mɛ nɛ bulal bhɔɔ nɛ Zɛɛb é mɛwala djas mɛ di etaala nɛ nen ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 1:4"/>Mɛ nɛ dyeebamyaala é mɛwala djas mɛ di edjaala étɛp'en ɛ, <verse eid="PHP 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 1:5"/>kɔ ɛsu ɛ mɛkwyeea mɛ bi nakwyee mɛ tɔ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal, kana dwoo bi nakan ɛmyaal Zɛɛb ɛ kɛkum dwoo pan mos'ak. <verse eid="PHP 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 1:6"/>Tin, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, Zɛɛb mot nakan mbɛɛ mɛsa mak pak'en ɔ, nyɛ aatɔ́ nɛ yɛ, kɛsilal dwoo ɛbula ɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 1:7"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ gham ɛwa bin tɔ lyem'am. Etɛɛ náá, biyɔ djas ɛ sama nɛ nam tɔ ɛkɛɛ ee Zɛɛb nadjɛ mɛ ɛ. Nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ, bi ɛ́ sama nɛ nam ye nakoozodi, dáa mɛ di nenak é membok'ak nɛghu é sok mɛ di elyaal nɛ bot náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di egoola ɛ ye ɛ́ etsɛɛtsɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 1:8"/>Zɛɛb ɛ́ tyaases'am, mɛ nɛ kwyɛl biyɔ djas dáa Yezu Klisto di ekwyɛl bin ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 1:9"/>Gwakeka sa mɛ di ewaab nɛ Zɛɛb tɔ mendjaala mam ɛ: ye ɛ́ náá, bi di nɛ mɛkwyɛla pak'en dhaa tyɛ. Da bi ɛ́ di bot ɛtiibal nɛ bot ɛgu etɛp ɛnyɔɛpe. <verse eid="PHP 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 1:10"/>Deenek, bi needi nɛ ghwyil ɛtiibal sa di ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. Tin, bi aadi ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ edhuud, ààbɛ nɛ sa ɛbiyo wat dwoo Klisto aazyɛ ɛ́. <verse eid="PHP 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 1:11"/>Beta náá, bi di nɛ mɛsa mɛ epiki e Zɛɛb di tɔ len ɛbuɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ Yezu Klisto, étɛp ɛduwal ɛ Zɛɛb, nɛ ɛdjɛ nyɛ duma.<verse eid="PHP 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛpegoolaa djala dik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 1:12"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ bi gu náá, sa mɛ naboma nɛ ye ɛ́, ye naasa náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal goolaa djala dik. <verse eid="PHP 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 1:13"/>Deenek, esodja ee di ebaal ndjaa boo kukuma ɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot djas nɛ kagu nenak náá, mɛ ɛ́ é membok ɛ etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ mot-mɛsa ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 1:14"/>Dáa bɛtɛ bɔn nyɛɛg nabee mɛ é membok ɛ, bɛtɛ nɛ bot pak'ɔɔ naazɛwa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɔɔ nɛ Ghɛŋ, bɔɔ batabela mɛghaaz mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Zɛɛb ààbɛ nɛ bwoo.<verse eid="PHP 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 1:15"/>Ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot pak'ɔɔ ɛpegoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto nɛ mbee lyem. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ ɛ́ nɛ mbee egeka nɛ nam. Tin, bɛdhiiti bɔn nyɛɛg goola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛ nɛ mbɛɛ lyem. <verse eid="PHP 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 1:16"/>Bot ɛ di egoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal nɛ mbɛɛ lyem ɔ, bɛ goola yɛ nɛ kwyɛl djas. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛsa mam wak ɛ́ ɛlyaal nɛ bot náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal mɛ di goola ɛ, ye ɛ́ tsɛɛtsɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 1:17"/>Tin, bɛdhiiti bot goola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛ nɛ mbee lyem. Ɛkwosak ɛ lɔɔ ɛ́ ɛpul, bɛ saŋ ɛ náá, bɛ baabil mezuk mam tɔ membok. <verse eid="PHP 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 1:18"/>Ye nakozoodi náá, egeka bɔɔ ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛghu egeka bɔɔ àànyɔ, sa di enyɔ ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá, Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto ɛpegoolaa. Deenek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala, mɛ aazodidi ɛ́ tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="PHP 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 1:19"/>Etɛɛ náá, mɛ nɛ gu náá, etɛp binek djas lyaal ɛ náá, Zɛɛb waatsik mɛ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mendjaala men nɛ ghwyil ɛ Sisim ɛ Yezu Klisto di ekwyee mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 1:20"/>Tin, mɛ tok nɛ ghwyil ɛdi nɛ sen dáa ye di náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ boo ɛbwaalel ɛ. Mos, mɛ nakoozogwyɛ, mɛ nakoozodi nɛ tsik, duma ɛ Klisto aadi ɛ́ nɛ nam é edi djas mɛ aadi ɛ́.<verse eid="PHP 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 1:21"/>Etɛɛ náá, ye ɛ́ bɛ mam ɔɔ, Klisto ɛ́ di tsik. É di'enek, ɛsyee moo ɛ́ mbɛɛ sa. <verse eid="PHP 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 1:22"/>Tin, yɛ bɛ náá, ɛdi nɛ tsik ɛpesa náá mɛ sa enɛm esa ɔɔ, é di'enek, mɛ ààgu sa mɛ aasɛ́ɛ pak ɛsyee nɛ tsik ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 1:23"/>Mɛ moo ɛ́ pak bɛman, mɛ ɛpekwyɛl ɛbet tsik mɛ di nɛ yɛ'aak, étɛp mɛ needi sama nɛ Klisto. Deenek ɛ di ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 1:24"/>Tin, ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ len náá, mɛ zoodi nɛ tsik. <verse eid="PHP 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 1:25"/>Dáa mɛ di nɛ ɛbwaalel ɛ tsik dáak ɛ, mɛ nɛ gu náá, mɛ aadidi ɛ́ sama nɛ nen étɛp mɛ needjɛ bin mɛghaaz mɛ ɛtɔ́ sok, nɛ ɛdi ɛ tɔ mɛmyaala tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb. <verse eid="PHP 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 1:26"/>Etɛɛ náá, é ghɛŋ mɛ aabula zɛdi pak'en ɛ, bi aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa Yezu Klisto aasa nɛ nam ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 1:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 1:27"/>Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkɛ dáa Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ Klisto di elɛɛ ɛ. Tin, mɛ zyɛ zɛbee bin nɛghu mɛ di ààzyɛ ɔɔ, ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ di ghiŋ tɔ sisim wat. Ye nyɔ ɛ́ náá, bi ɛ́ di epyet nɛ lyem wat étɛp ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb kɔ ɛsu ɛ Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="PHP 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 1:28"/>Sa bi ààgwak bwoo nɛ bot ɛ mɛbhuka men. Yɛ aadi ɛ́ ndem di elyaal náá, biyɔ, bi eezebela tsik, bɔɔ, bɛ eezewo ze. Tin, etɛp binek djas dus ɛ́ pɛ daa Zɛɛb. <verse eid="PHP 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 1:29"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb naadjɛ bin ghwyil ɛsa mɛsa mɛ Klisto. Tin nyɛ naadjɛ bin mbɛɛ bhwoob ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ nɛ. Yɛ ààpasik tin, nyɛ naabaadjɛ bin ghwyil ɛzuk dáa nyɛ nazuk ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 1:30"/>Mena ɛpeduuka tuub wat. Bi nɛ gu ɛnyɔɛpe náá, é ghɛŋ sok mɛ nadi eduu tuub tak, nenak mɛ baazoduu ɛ́ tuub tak wat. Mos, biyɔ ɛ́ kadi eduu tuub tak.<verse eid="PHP 1:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PHP 2"/>
  <para style="s">Klisto moo ɛ́ mot-mɛsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 2:1"/>Ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Klisto nɛ djɛ bin mɛghaaz e? Bi ààbela mɛghaaz tɔ Kwyɛl ɛ Klisto? Bi ɛ́ tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Sisim na Dɛɛ? Bi ɛ́ nɛ kwyɛl nɛ lyem ghoŋ nɛ bɔn bɛsɔ bin e? <verse eid="PHP 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 2:2"/>Yɛ bɛ deenek ɔɔ, saka náá, mɛ di tɔ mɛmyaala é bɛmɛwala djas. Dika tɔ ɛgwakel pak'en. Betka náá, elyem bin di nɛ esiiza wat, elyem bin di tɔ esa djas bi di ekwyɛl ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 2:3"/>Sa bi ààsa dhiiti sonok nɛ mbee lyem, sa bi ààsaa náá bot duwal min men. Tin, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛsila, beeka náá bɔn bɛsɔ bin eedhaa bin. <verse eid="PHP 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 2:4"/>Deenek, sa mot ààzokwyɛɛg nyel'ɛ met, ye nyɔ ɛ náá, nyɛ baakwyɛɛg bɛdhiiti bot. <verse eid="PHP 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 2:5"/>Dika nɛ mbɛɛ mɛfulu dáa Yezu Klisto nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 2:6"/>Nyɛy mot di tyee wat nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:6">nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ ààkwyɛl ɛben ɛ nyel kɔ ɛsu ɛ tak.<verse eid="PHP 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 2:7"/>«Ààbɛ», nyɛy ɛmet naabyen etɛp djas nyɛ nadi nɛ yɛ ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:7">étɛp ɛdi kwom.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Nyɛ nakadi ɛ́ mot pak bot.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:7">Nyɛ nabyel ɛ mot nɛ nyel epuud dáa bot djas.<verse eid="PHP 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 2:8"/>Nyɛ naamyaal ɛdi tɔ mɛsila.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:8">Nyɛ naalyaal ɛlooba ɛ lɛ kɛkum dwoo ɛsyee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:8">ɛsyee ɛ nyɛ nabemaa é mɛlaaba ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 2:9"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ Zɛɛb naben nyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PHP 2:9">Nyɛ naadjɛ nyɛ di di edhaa edi djas ɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:9">nɛ din di kɔ min djas ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 2:10"/>Nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛ náá,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">bot djas tɔ gwoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">kɔ bɔs zɛnɔɔ si bɔs,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">pyak mɛboŋ mɔɔ si sok bhwoob ɛ Yezu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:10">étɛp ɛduwal din ɛ lɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 2:11"/>Nyɛ nakwyɛl ɛsa deenek ɛ, étɛp bot djas neeke kɔ ɛsu ɛ duma Zɛɛb Sɛɛg náá:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PHP 2:11">«Ye ɛ́ Yezu Klisto ɛ́ di Ghɛŋ!»<verse eid="PHP 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kaska dáa mengel kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 2:12"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, bi nadi elooba nɛ nam é sok mɛ nadi pak'en ɛ. É di'enek, dáa mɛ kadi mos ààbɛ pak'en ɛ, gheeleloobaka nɛ nam dhaa dáa bi naboozezyɛ nɛ ɛsesa mam pak'en ɛ. Deenek, waka zii tɔ mɛsa étɛp ɛlyaal náá, bi ɛ́ nɛ tsik, da bi ɛlyaal náá, bi nɛ kaab Zɛɛb ɛbuɛpe. <verse eid="PHP 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 2:13"/>Etɛɛ náá, Zɛɛb nyɛy ɛmet ɛ di edjɛ bin ghwyil, étɛp bi neesa ɛkwosak ɛ lɛ dáa nyɛ ɛmet di ekwyɛl ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 2:14"/>Saka mɛsa djas, ààlɛka, ààwaya, <verse eid="PHP 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 2:15"/>étɛp bi needi ààliiaa nɛ yɛ ɛbiyoɛpe, bi needi bot ɛ epiki. Bi needi bɔn Zɛɛb, ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ tɔ sama bɛmbee ɛ bot, bot ɛ ɛbiyo kɔ ɛko ɛ bɔs'ak. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛkas tɔ lɔɔ ɛ dáa ekwyikwyen tɔ gwoo, <verse eid="PHP 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 2:16"/>nɛ ɛgoola bɛ mɛkpa mɛ tsik. Deenek, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛmyaala nɛ nen dwoo Klisto aabula ɛ, etɛɛ náá, mɛsa mam nɛ mezuk mam nabɛ ɛ́ ààbɛ e toto. <verse eid="PHP 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 2:17"/>Yɛ kobɛ náá, ghiya yam eesee étɛp ɛkala kɔ buwa bi di edjɛ nɛ Zɛɛb, étɛp mɛsa mɛ ɛdum ɛ koŋ ɛ len nɛ nɛ ɔ. Yɛ sael deenek ɔɔ, mɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala, mɛ aasa náá menabɛlka djas di tɔ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="PHP 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 2:18"/>Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ biyɔ, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛmyaala, da bi ɛwa mɛ tɔ mɛmyaala men.<verse eid="PHP 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpelwom Timote bɛ nɛ Epafoolodhit pɛ daa bot ɛ Filip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 2:19"/>Nɛ ɛbwaalel mɛ di nɛ yɛ nɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu ɛ. Mɛ bee ɛkɛɛ náá, mɛ moo aadhis Timote pɛ daa lin. Etɛɛ náá, é sok nyɛ aadjɛ mɛ menduk min ɛ, mɛ aabela mɛghaaz. <verse eid="PHP 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 2:20"/>Ye ɛ́ nyɛy zodi ekɛm mɛ tɔ etɛp bam. Nyɛ ɛ́ di etaala nɛ nen nɛ tsɛɛtsɛ tyee wat nɛ nam. <verse eid="PHP 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 2:21"/>Etɛɛ náá, bɛdhiiti bot suu ɛ́ ɛkoobal etɛp bɔɔ met, ààkoobal yɛ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 2:22"/>Biyɔ bɛmet nɛ gu dáa Timote nalyaal esosoob bɛ, dáa mɔn di nɛ sɛɛg ɛ. Nyɛ naazɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛɛ Bhaadal. <verse eid="PHP 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 2:23"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mɛ aadhis bin nwyak ɛ é sok mɛ aabee náá, etɛp bam moo ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHP 2:24"/>Kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ghɛŋ, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mɛ moo aazyɛ zɛbee bin.<verse eid="PHP 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHP 2:25"/>É di'enek, mɛ bee ɛ́ náá, ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe náá, mɛ bulal bin mɔn ɛ nyɛɛg'ena Epafoloodhit. Nyɛ ɛ́ mot di egyee bis nɛ nɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ Klisto ɔ, mot bis nɛ nɛ di eduu tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɔ, mot bi nadhis mɛ nwyak étɛp nyɛ neezɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ nadi esa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="PHP 2:26"/>Nyɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ gwyes ɛbaabee biyɔ djas. Deenek, nyɛ naadyeebatuŋ é sok nyɛ nagu náá, bi naagwak náá, nyɛ nadi ebɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="PHP 2:27"/>Nyɛ naadyeebabɛ, kunaa-kuna nɛ ɛsyee. Tin, Zɛɛb naagek nyɛ ghoŋ, ààkoobɛ nɛ nyɛy nyɛ ɛmet, ye ɛ́ dɔɔ nɛ mam, étɛp mɛ needi aadi nɛ boo ghoŋ tɔ lyem. <verse eid="PHP 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="PHP 2:28"/>Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ mɛ di edhis bin nwyak ghaal-ghaal, étɛp bi neemyaala é sok bi aaboma ɛ. Étɛp mɛ needi ààbaadi nɛ ghoŋ tɔ lyem. <verse eid="PHP 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="PHP 2:29"/>Deenek, myaalka nyɛ nɛ boo mɛmyaala djas, dáa mɔn ɛ nyɛɛg'en tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Ghɛŋ. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdi nɛ lyem nɛ mbi binɔk bot, <verse eid="PHP 2:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="PHP 2:30"/>etɛɛ náá, nyɛ nabɛ ɛ́ nyɛ naawaagwyɛ étɛp mɛsa ɛ Klisto. Nyɛ naaka nyel étɛp ɛzɛkwyee mɛ tɔ mɛsa mɛ bi nadi ààbɛ nɛ ghwyil ɛzɛkwyee mɛ biyɔ bɛmet ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 2:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PHP 3"/>
  <para style="s">Pɔl zowa ɛbwaalel ɛ lɛ ɛ nɛ Yezu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 3:1"/>Nenak, bɔn nyɛɛg bam dika nɛ mɛmyaala tɔ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Ghɛŋ. Yɛ bɛ náá, mɛ ɛpebasal ɛlɛɛ bin sa mɛ nazekwyal ɔɔ, ye ɛ́ étɛp ɛbaal ɛ bin. <verse eid="PHP 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 3:2"/>Dika ɛtsetaɛpe nɛ bot ɛ di esa ɛbiyo ɔ. Bot binɔk ɛ́ bɛghil ɛ beka, bɛ bee beka ɛ dáa boo sonok! <verse eid="PHP 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 3:3"/>Ghuna, ye ɛ́ menabɛlka ɛ́ di nɛ tɛtɛ beka, etɛɛ náá, mena ɛpesaka mɛsa mɛ Zɛɛb tɔ Sisim yɛ. Menaka ɛ́ nɛ mɛmyaala étɛp ɛdi ɛ sama nɛ Yezu Klisto. Mena ààwaka ɛbwaalel ɛ lena kɔ esa ee bot ɛ bɔs di esa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 3:4"/>Mam pe ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛ diig bet kɔ ɛsu ɛ embi bɛmɛsa mɛ bot ɛ bɔs di esa ɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="PHP 3:4">Mɛ aadi ɛ́ nɛ boo gham ɛsa yɛ dhaa bɔɔ. <verse eid="PHP 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 3:5"/>Mɛ naniigelaa beka ɛ, mɛlu mɛtɛn nɛ elɛl bhis ɛbyel ɛ lam. Mɛ ɛ́ mot kyee dik Yisalaɛl, mot mbyak ɛ Bɛɛzamɛ. Lii'am ɛ́ ebhele, mɛ nabyel ɛ tɔ mɔ bot ɛ mbyak ebhele. Mɛ nadi eduwal etsi eYuda dáa tɛtɛ Falizyɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 3:6"/>Mɛ nadi ɛ́ nɛ zii dhaa tyɛ, é sok mɛ nadi etiig bot ɛ nadi edum koŋ nɛ Klisto ɔ. Dum nɛ tsik epiki nakwyalaa tɔ mɛkana mɛ etsi ɛ, mɛ nadi ɛ́ ààbɛ nɛ ndjɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 3:7"/>Tin, sa mɛ nadi ebee náá ye ɛ́ ɛnyɔɛpe nɛ nam ɛ, mɛ kabee yɛ mos ɛ é mis toto kɔ ɛsu ɛ Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 3:8"/>Esa djas mɛ nazesa ɛ, mɛ kabee yɛ é mis mɛ toto, kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa di nɛ boo mɛtaŋ dhaa esonok djas ɛ. Sa tak ɛ́ ɛgu ɛ Yezu Klisto Ghɛŋ'am. Dum nɛ nɛ, mɛ eezekat ɛsa esonok djas. Étɛp ɛdi ɛ sama nɛ Klisto ɛ, mɛ kabee esonok binek djas ɛ dáa eput esonok di egoka nɛ ɛmwasaa kɔ ɛkwyiid ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 3:9"/>Étɛp mɛ needi sama nɛ nɛ ɛnyɔɛpe, mɛ ààkakwyɛɛg nyel'am met. Mɛ tokapɛ mot epiki kɔ ɛsu ɛduwal etsi. Mɛ ɛ́ mot epiki etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛpedum koŋ nɛ Klisto mot di mot epiki ɔ. Mbi yenek epiki dus ɛ́ nɛ Zɛɛb. Nyɛ ɛ́ di esa náá, mot di piki kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛdum koŋ nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 3:10"/>Sa djas mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ, ye ɛ́ náá, mɛ gu Klisto nɛ mɛbwala mɛ yii ɛgom bhis ɛsyee, nɛ ɛzuk sama nɛ nɛ, nɛ ɛbaagwyɛ sama nɛ nɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 3:11"/>Mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ɛbwaalel náá, mam pe aagomlaa pak myoŋ.<verse eid="PHP 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tɛtɛ mɛpek mɛ ɛsum ɛkaab étɛp ɛbela efute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 3:12"/>Mɛ ààpake náá, mɛ eezebela efute mɛ di esaŋ ɛ, nɛghu mɛ ɛ́ mot di egu etɛp djas ɔ. Tin, mɛ dinaa tɔ ɛsum ɛ kaab étɛp ɛbela efute, etɛɛ náá, Yezu Klisto eezewa mɛ tɔ ze yɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 3:13"/>«Ààbɛ» bɔn nyɛɛg, mɛ ààbee náá, mɛ eezebela efute tak. Tin, esok mɛ di esa dhiiti sonok ɛ. Mɛ kadjoak ɛ pɛ sok, ààkadjoak pɛ bhis koŋ'am. É di'enek, mɛ dyeebasa mɛghaaz ɛ étɛp ɛdu etɛp di pɛ sok ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 3:14"/>Deenek, mɛ dyeebasum kaab ɛ étɛp mɛ neebela efute ee Zɛɛb. Ye ɛ́ sa Zɛɛb nakwom mɛ ɛ, é sok nyɛ nadjóo mɛ dum nɛ sa Yezu Klisto nasa kɔ ɛsu ɛ lam ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 3:15"/>Menabɛlka djas bot dinaa mena eezepyetka tɔ ɛdum ɛ koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ, mena goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛsiiza deenek. Tin, mena ààbaadika nɛ dhiiti egeka e sis ɔɔ, Zɛɛb ɛ waalyaal dáa mena di egoka nɛ ɛsa ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 3:16"/>Ye nakozoodi dáa, dhjoogheeduka ze Zɛɛb nalyaal mena ɛ, yii bot di boozezyɛ nɛ ɛduka dɔɔ nɛ mos ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 3:17"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg, biyɔ djas duka mɛfulu mam. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛdu mɛfulu mɛ bot ɛ dinaa, bɛ ɛpedu mɛfulu ee bɛ nabaŋa pɛ daa les ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 3:18"/>Mɛ nɛ dyeebalɛɛ bin yɛ ngwyis. Nenak yak, mɛ ɛpebaabasal nɛ meŋal é mis: Ye ɛ́ nɛ mbula bot di ekakɛ mos dáa bot ɛ swaka mezuk ɛ Klisto é mɛlaaba. <verse eid="PHP 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 3:19"/>Bɛ aaswaala ɛ, bɛ eezewo ze, etɛɛ náá, zɛɛb ɔɔ ɛ́ mɔ. É di'enek, bɛ nɛ myaala nɛ esa esyen bɛ di esa ɛ. Tɔ esimza bɔɔ, ye ɛ́ esa e bɔs. <verse eid="PHP 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 3:20"/>Yɛ kabɛ menabɛlka ɔ, menaka ɛ́ bɔn Zɛɛb. Dum nɛ tɛp tak ɛ, mena dika ebhwood Mɛtsik bot'enaka, Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto. <verse eid="PHP 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 3:21"/>Deenek, nyɛ waaswola mbee nyel ee bot dika nɛ yɛ'aak, étɛp ye neenɔŋel nɛ nyel'ɛ di nɛ duma ɛ. Tin, nyɛ aasa yɛ ɛ nɛ ghwyil di sa náá, esonok djas looba nɛ nɛ ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 3:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PHP 4"/>
  <para style="s">Mɛlyo nɛ mɛtiŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHP 4:1"/>Bɔn nyɛɛg bam, biyɔ bot ɛ mɛ di ekwyɛl ɛbaabee ɔ, biyɔ ɛ́ di esa náá, bum lyem'am di tɔ mɛmyaala, biyɔ ɛ́ di kɔtɔ duu'am. Deenek, bɔn nyɛɛg bam, dika sosoob tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Ghɛŋ.<verse eid="PHP 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHP 4:2"/>Wɔy Evodhi nɛ Syntis, mɛ ɛpedjaala nɛ nen, dika tɔ ɛgwakel pak'en sama nɛ Ghɛŋ. <verse eid="PHP 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHP 4:3"/>Dɔɔ nɛ wɔy, mot di sosoob tɔ ɛsa mɛsa lɔɔg wat nɛ nam ɔ, mɛ ɛpewaab nɛ nɔ náá, wɔ kwyee boa ba binɔk. Etɛɛ náá, bɛ naadyeebasa mɛghaaz é ɛkwyee tɔ mɛsa mɛ ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal. Ye ɛ́ tyee wat nɛ Kelemɔ nɛ bɛdhiiti bot ɛ mɛsa, yii min mɔɔ di tɔ mɛkana mɛ tsik ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHP 4:4"/>Dika tɔ mɛmyaala e mɛwala djas kɔ ɛsu ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Ghɛŋ. Mɛ ɛpebaabasal náá, dika nɛ mɛmyaala. <verse eid="PHP 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHP 4:5"/>Beta náá, bot bee enɛm esa bin, etɛɛ náá, ɛbula Ghɛŋ eezekuna. <verse eid="PHP 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHP 4:6"/>Nàbemka ba nɛ dhiiti sonok, ye nakoozodi dáa. Ye goka ɛ́ náá, bi djaala, nɛ ɛduwal zɛnɔɔ ɛbulal bhɔɔ dum nɛ esonok djas bi di ewaab nɛ Zɛɛb e mɛwala djas ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHP 4:7"/>Beta náá, egwyem e Zɛɛb di edhaa etsoŋ djas ɛ, baal elyem bin nɛ ɛbaal esimza bin tɔ ɛgwakel nɛ Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHP 4:8"/>Deenek, nɛ bɔn nyɛɛg bam, waka lyem tɔ sa djas di enyɔ ɛ, nɛ sa djas di egoka nɛ ɛkwyɛlaa ɛ. Bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa lyem tɔ sa djas di tsɛɛtsɛ ɛ, sa di egoka nɛ duu ɛ, sa djas di piki ɛ, sa djas di dɛɛ ɛ. Deenek, bi goka ɛ́ nɛ ɛwa esiiza bin tɔ esa djas di egoka nɛ ɛduwal nɛghu ɛwa lyem. <verse eid="PHP 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHP 4:9"/>Waka, esa djas ee bi nadjek nɛ nam ɛ, nɛ esa djas bi nagwak nɛ nam, zɛnɔɔ esa djas bi nabee mɛ esa ɛ, waka yɛ tɔ mɛsa. Tɔ etɛp binek djas, beta náá, Zɛɛb mot di nɛ egwyem ɔ, di nɛ nen sama.<verse eid="PHP 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pɔl ɛpeghaapɛɛ bot ɛ ghaada Filip</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHP 4:10"/>Mɛ dyeebagwak mɛmyaala ɛbuɛpe kɔ ɛsu ɛ Ghɛŋ etɛɛ náá, bi eelyaal mɛ lyaala sis kwyɛl bi di nɛ yɛ nɛ nam ɛ. Mɛ ààpake deenek etɛɛ náá, bi ààkataala mɛ. Tin, ye ɛ́ náá, bi nabɛ ɛ́ ààbela mɔɔ ɛpɛɛd ɛwala ee lyaal mɛ kwyɛl tak. <verse eid="PHP 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHP 4:11"/>Tin, mɛ ààlii deenek etɛɛ náá, mɛ ɛ́ tɔ ɛsɛɛga. Bela náá, mɛ naadjek dáa mot di egoka nɛ ɛmyaala nɛ sa nyɛ zodi nɛ yɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHP 4:12"/>Mɛ nɛ gu dáa mɛ di egoka nɛ ɛdi tɔ edjel nɛghu tɔ mɛnyɔ ɛ. Mɛ naadjek mɛpek mɛ ɛdi tɔ mɛmyaala é mɛwala djas ye nakoozodi náá, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ za nɛghu mɛ ɛ́ nɛ djil. Ye nakoozodi náá, mɛ ɛ́ tɔ mɛvu nɛghu tɔ ɛsɛɛga. <verse eid="PHP 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHP 4:13"/>Tin, mɛ ɛ́ nɛ ghwyil ɛsa esa binek djas etɛɛ náá, Klisto ɛpedjɛ mɛ ghwyil. <verse eid="PHP 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHP 4:14"/>Deenek, bi naasa ɛnyɔɛpe é sok bi nadi egek mɛ ghoŋ kɔ ɛsu ɛ mezuk mam ɛ.<verse eid="PHP 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHP 4:15"/>Biyɔ bot ɛ ghaada Filip, bi nɛ gu biyɔ bɛmet náá, é ghɛŋ mɛ nadus kɔ ghaada Masedwan ɛ, é sok mɛ nakan ɛgoola Mbɛɛ Bhaadal ɛ, bi nabɛ ɛ́ sim zɛɛga ndjaa mendjaala mɛ wat nakwyee mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="PHP 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHP 4:16"/>É sok mɛ nadi tɔ ghaada Tesalonik ɛ, ye nabɛ ɛ́ bi naadhis mɛ sa djas mɛ nadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHP 4:17"/>Ye tok náá, mɛ saŋ ɛ náá, bi gheedhis-dhis mɛtom. Tin, mɛ kwyɛl ɛ náá, Zɛɛb sa bin enɛm kɔ ɛsu ɛ sa bi nadjɛ mɛ ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHP 4:18"/>Mɛ naabela esa djas ee bi nadhis mɛ ɛ. Mɛ tokapɛ nɛ gwyes dhiiti sonok, etɛɛ náá, mɛ naazebela yɛ é mɛmbɔ mɛ Epafoloodhit. Tin, esa ee bi dhis mɛ ɛ, ye ɛ́ dáa ɛtom na mbɛɛ mɛnuub, ye ɛ́ buwa Zɛɛb di emyaala yɛ ɛ, buwa nyɛ di ekwyɛl ɛ. <verse eid="PHP 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHP 4:19"/>Zɛɛb'am ɛ waadjɛ bin esa djas ee bi aadi nɛ gwyes tak ɛ, tɔ duma mɛvu mɛ nyɛ di nɛ yɛ, kɔ ɛsu ɛ ɛgwakel ɛ len nɛ Yezu Klisto.<verse eid="PHP 4:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHP 4:20"/>Beta náá, duma di nɛ Zɛɛb Sɛɛg'es kɔm-kɔm sii nɛ kɔm! Amɛn.<verse eid="PHP 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɛswosel mɛ mɛsik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHP 4:21"/>Swoska bot djas ɛ di edum koŋ nɛ Zɛɛb ɔ nɛ din ɛ Yezu Klisto. Bɔn nyɛɛg bin, bot ɛ bis nɛ bɛ nɔɔ di ɔ, bɛ eeswos bin. <verse eid="PHP 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHP 4:22"/>Ekeletyɛ djas eeswos bin, daŋ-daŋ ɛ bot ɛ́ di esa mɛsa tɔ ndjaa boo mɛkoozi Sezaad ɔ.<verse eid="PHP 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHP 4:23"/>Beta náá, enɛm nɛ embɛɛ ɛ Ghɛŋ Yezu Klisto nɛ Sisim Zɛɛb di nɛ biyɔ djas.<verse eid="PHP 4:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHP 4"/>
</usx>
